<overview>
<p>Clan mechanized wheeled squads transport a squad-strength element in wheeled APCs for road-mobile garrison operations. Optimized for speed on developed surfaces, these formations patrol road networks, escort convoys, and respond to security incidents on worlds with adequate infrastructure. They trade off-road capability for lower operating costs and faster transit times compared to tracked alternatives.</p>
</overview>

